              }
            }
          },
          "description": "Each G1 stop since the last timings message: its frame (the id in its g1 message) and frame capture to the STOP painted, in ms"
        }
      },
      "description": "The device's own timings, for the acceptance numbers (landmarks ms per frame, frame to STOP): sent every 5 s while there are new ones and when the session ends. Numbers and frame ids only. The server records it and does nothing else with it."
